      <title>新泽西州提请最高法院裁决预测市场法律地位</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260902/%E6%96%B0%E6%B3%BD%E8%A5%BF%E5%B7%9E%E6%8F%90%E8%AF%B7%E6%9C%80%E9%AB%98%E6%B3%95%E9%99%A2%E8%A3%81%E5%86%B3%E9%A2%84%E6%B5%8B%E5%B8%82%E5%9C%BA%E6%B3%95%E5%BE%8B%E5%9C%B0%E4%BD%8D/</link>
